<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan tourist earnings up 25 pct first half '96.</title>
<headline>Moroccan tourist earnings up 25 pct first half '96.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tourists spent a total of 5.15 billion dirhams ($592 million), an increase of 25.7 percent in the first six months of this year compared with the same time last year, Morocco's Office des Changes said.</p>
<p>In its latest bulletin, the trade regulatory body said income from tourists rose by 1.05 billion dirhams from 4.09 billion in the first half of 1995.</p>
<p>An estimated 3.0 million tourists visited Morocco every year, mainly from Europe, officials said.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.7 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom (212-7 726518)</p>
